      "content": "I checked the applicable policy for delayed-flight compensation.\n\nFor delayed flights, compensation is only available if the reservation is changed or cancelled, and the gesture in that case would be a certificate after that change or cancellation. Because you want to keep your booking unchanged, I’m not able to provide any compensation, travel credit, or goodwill certificate here.\n\nIf you would like, I can transfer you to a human agent.",
